{"overview":"مینجای، شناگر سابق که به‌دلیل بیماری یک پا را از دست داد، اکنون دانشجوی دکتراست و زندگی ساکت و منظمی ساخته است؛ اما یوجین، دانشجوی کارشناسی ارشد که پس از گم شدن مسیرش دوباره شروع می‌کند، این تعادل را به هم می‌زند. در یک آزمایشگاه رباتیک، عشقشان به‌صورت آتشین، تلخ‌ شیرین و لطیف می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Minjae, a former swimmer, lost a leg to illness. Now a PhD student, he's built a quiet, controlled life, until Yujin, a master's student starting over after losing her way, throws it off balance. In a robotics lab, their romance turns fiery, bittersweet, and tender.","tagline_en":"Two hearts learning to love.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/iwpbhVz6DjgWzZeCMMslYmJ7Bks.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":["안판석","민효정"],"crew_en":["Ahn Pan-seok","Min Hyo-jeong"],"countries":["KR"],"cast":[{"name":"چو یونگ وو","role":"Park Min-jae","photo":"/nGICKq8yq7G6nDUNVjrUoMe4iQ0.jpg","en":"Choo Young-woo"},{"name":"김소현","role":"Lim You-jin","photo":"/jrRXistOzBtfRkvf3WrxSmyDKBY.jpg","en":"Kim So-hyun"},{"name":"김민","role":"Choi Han-gyeol","photo":"/yroLxyelxGjmw0c6igUCNekaEW0.jpg","en":"Kim Min"},{"name":"이규성","role":"Eom Tae-ho","photo":"/6KOKFGaizHwl1yMHEphzWaUF4UH.jpg","en":"Lee Kyu-sung"},{"name":"심혜진","role":"Hong Eun-joo","photo":"/dFZksi2ovgOy43fqZUHgzvi1988.jpg","en":"Shim Hye-jin"},{"name":"김민석","role":"Im Yoo-seong","photo":"/oZNJCOMEqFPzN4xSSGulE62gUMZ.jpg","en":"Kim Min-seok"},{"name":"박혁권","role":"Im Yong-seok","photo":"/d4p9iRGNkZUZrFenD0gj0nQN3gR.jpg","en":"Park Hyuk-kwon"},{"name":"서정연","role":"Seo Mi-yeong","photo":"/za1tTtSULKsZPN0u1oTs2Iival0.jpg","en":"Seo Jeong-yeon"},{"name":"장인섭","role":"Lee Ji-hoon","photo":"/gFmUjdGIqd8ahUkIWOKZP1B6eJa.jpg","en":"Jang In-sub"},{"name":"이창훈","role":"Ahn Jae-hong","photo":"/gunEDHw5kp3Por19IelR8qOp8kL.jpg","en":"Lee Chang-hoon"},{"name":"임진효","role":"Kim Se-jin","photo":"/6vn9aVR3cXTgdieN60Pdfpnuh9n.jpg","en":"Im Jin-hyo"},{"name":"이석형","